WEBVTT

00:03.230 --> 00:05.150
Listen carefully, Sophie.

00:05.670 --> 00:07.400
Yes, Mother.

00:07.620 --> 00:10.860
One day, you will meet the Exalted Hero.

00:11.700 --> 00:15.030
To save the world, you must serve him.

00:15.460 --> 00:16.390
I will.

00:18.330 --> 00:22.330
Mother, what kind of person
 is the Exalted Hero?

00:22.820 --> 00:28.960
A strong, kind, and humble person.

00:29.610 --> 00:31.940
Strong, kind, and humble...

00:33.500 --> 00:34.930
<i>The Exalted Hero is...</i>

00:36.110 --> 00:37.530
<i>The Exalted Hero is...</i>

00:40.650 --> 00:42.920
<i>such a wonderful person!</i>

