02:02.970 --> 02:13.990
<b>Starting Life
 in Another 
World With 
My Big Sister</b>

02:13.990 --> 02:16.950
<b>Episode 6</b>

02:13.990 --> 02:16.950
<b>The Hero 
\hand the 
Big Sister</b>

02:43.470 --> 02:45.050
Nice work, Asahi!

02:46.170 --> 02:50.430
Okay. Fighting wolves 
has gotten a lot easier...

02:53.960 --> 02:55.520
Oh, um...

02:55.520 --> 02:57.530
A-Are you the parent?

03:04.980 --> 03:08.370
Big Sis Earthquake!

03:16.310 --> 03:19.350
Good job taking care of 
those wolves on your own.

03:19.350 --> 03:21.130
You've really improved, Asahi.

03:21.930 --> 03:26.350
It's not so convincing when you just 
took out that giant parent wolf in one hit.

03:26.640 --> 03:29.060
<i>My big sister's as big a cheat as ever.</i>

03:29.510 --> 03:33.440
<i>We were both summoned to the same world,
 so this gap between us is just mean.</i>

03:33.440 --> 03:38.170
Can't some "power of the hero" awaken 
inside me? Then I could be unrivaled, too.

03:38.170 --> 03:40.530
Asahi, you're hurt.

03:40.530 --> 03:42.040
Huh? You're right.

03:42.040 --> 03:43.850
Are you all right? Does it hurt?

03:43.850 --> 03:44.700
Okay.

03:44.700 --> 03:47.230
Let's hit it with a Double EX Potion!

03:47.770 --> 03:48.410
Huh?

03:48.870 --> 03:50.540
It's just a scratch.

03:50.540 --> 03:52.790
I see. So a quick lick and it'll heal right up?

03:52.790 --> 03:53.870
Pretty much.

03:53.870 --> 03:56.640
Then your big sister 
shall licky-lick it for you!

03:56.640 --> 03:58.020
Licky-lick.

03:58.020 --> 03:58.590
What?

03:58.590 --> 04:01.050
Licky-lick.

04:01.050 --> 04:02.980
Licky-lick.

04:02.400 --> 04:03.880
Stop that!

04:02.980 --> 04:06.490
Licky-lick.

04:06.490 --> 04:07.640
E-Escape!

04:06.490 --> 04:08.140
Licky-lick.

04:11.560 --> 04:13.800
I somehow managed to shake her.

04:13.800 --> 04:16.980
But if I succeeded in 
getting away from Maya-nee,

04:17.370 --> 04:19.550
I really must have improved.

04:19.550 --> 04:20.470
Hey.

04:21.360 --> 04:23.740
Don't just stand in 
the middle of the path.

04:24.110 --> 04:26.080
Oh, I'm sorry.

04:26.080 --> 04:27.810
Get outta our way, dumb brat.

04:27.810 --> 04:28.930
What a nuisance.

04:31.130 --> 04:33.960
What was that about? 
What an obnoxious group.

04:36.440 --> 04:38.040
A-Are you all right?

04:38.040 --> 04:41.050
Ow, ow, ow...

04:44.080 --> 04:46.010
<i>She's cute.</i>

04:49.640 --> 04:50.720
Are you all right?

04:51.050 --> 04:52.650
Here, take my hand.

04:53.140 --> 04:54.240
Yes.

04:54.730 --> 04:56.940
Thank you so...

04:57.530 --> 04:59.440
Are you really all right?

04:59.440 --> 05:01.890
A strong, kind...

05:01.890 --> 05:03.510
You're not hurt, are you?

05:04.190 --> 05:06.220
I-I'm sorry.

05:06.220 --> 05:07.350
Up we go.

05:07.350 --> 05:09.330
I wasn't paying attention.

05:09.330 --> 05:12.540
No, I'm the one who wasn't 
looking where I was going.

05:12.540 --> 05:14.540
...and humble person.

05:14.540 --> 05:16.970
Oh, you're hurt! This is awful!

05:17.300 --> 05:18.540
Oh. No, this is...

05:18.850 --> 05:22.000
O gods, mend this wound.

05:22.730 --> 05:23.590
Heal!

05:23.900 --> 05:25.540
Recovery magic?

05:25.540 --> 05:27.180
Are you a healer?

05:27.560 --> 05:30.720
Yes. My name is Sophie Peaceful.

05:30.720 --> 05:33.920
Thank you. I'm Ikusaba Asahi.

05:33.920 --> 05:35.980
Hey! Hurry up and get over here, healer!

05:35.980 --> 05:38.230
What're you doing? We'll leave you behind.

05:38.650 --> 05:40.380
Then, I'll take my leave now.

05:40.740 --> 05:42.480
I'm sorry!

05:42.480 --> 05:44.570
We're in a hurry here, you know.

05:44.570 --> 05:46.270
Right. I'm very sorry.

05:46.270 --> 05:47.980
You're such a clod, you know that?

05:47.980 --> 05:52.200
You can't go dungeon-delving without a healer.
We have to take what we can get.

05:52.200 --> 05:53.490
I'm sorry.

05:53.770 --> 05:56.750
Okay, let's move out, Pitch-Black Brigade.

05:57.020 --> 05:59.970
All that treasure
in the dungeon is ours!

06:00.560 --> 06:01.930
We'll be rich.

06:01.930 --> 06:03.750
Come on, let's go, girly.

06:03.750 --> 06:05.420
C-Coming!

06:05.930 --> 06:07.930
Those people were members of her party?

06:08.720 --> 06:14.830
I caught up to you. It's licky-licking time!

06:17.480 --> 06:19.590
What's this? The cut's gone?

06:20.410 --> 06:23.600
A healer girl I just met 
took care of it for me.

06:24.790 --> 06:26.360
What does a "healer" do?

06:26.840 --> 06:32.120
Oh, they heal wounds and status ailments
like poison or paralysis. It's a character class.

06:32.620 --> 06:35.240
They're no good at attacking 
or whatever, though.

06:35.240 --> 06:39.780
Sounds useful. So they're essentially 
walking recovery potions, huh?

06:41.590 --> 06:45.800
If you treat them like tools, we'll get 
complaints from all over the country, so don't.

06:46.350 --> 06:50.340
Well, Asahi, you have your big sister to 
lick your wounds, and that's good enough.

06:53.120 --> 06:55.060
Maya-nee! My cut's already healed!

06:55.060 --> 06:58.430
But your big sister wants to 
licky-lick you all the time, Asahi.

06:58.430 --> 07:00.270
Get away from me!

07:01.180 --> 07:03.190
Asahi-kun! Perfect timing!

07:03.190 --> 07:06.150
A party hasn't come back from 
a dungeon. Please go save them!

07:06.460 --> 07:07.240
Huh?

07:08.280 --> 07:10.360
So to explain a little...

07:10.360 --> 07:15.470
It's rumored there's a big treasure
 in a dungeon at the foot of a mountain.

07:15.470 --> 07:17.950
Yup, seems like that'd create a fuss.

07:17.950 --> 07:20.470
A flood of adventurers have gone there.

07:20.470 --> 07:23.710
But the monsters are really strong, 
so everyone's come back.

07:24.150 --> 07:26.590
In that case, there shouldn't
 be a problem, right?

07:26.590 --> 07:30.470
Well, the thing is, there's one 
party that hasn't come back.

07:30.720 --> 07:34.090
It's a party called the Pitch-Black Brigade.

07:34.540 --> 07:37.100
That's the one that girl was in!

07:40.600 --> 07:43.940
E-Everyone g-got eaten!

07:47.010 --> 07:48.730
How did things turn out like this?

07:49.030 --> 07:50.070
O gods...

07:50.420 --> 07:51.610
Gods!

07:56.950 --> 08:01.120
I-If you eat me, I won't taste good!

08:01.120 --> 08:03.200
S-Someone!

08:03.200 --> 08:04.410
Gods!

08:04.410 --> 08:06.880
Exalted Hero!

08:15.360 --> 08:16.490
Are you all right?

08:17.310 --> 08:18.430
You're...

08:18.660 --> 08:19.940
Are you hurt?

08:19.940 --> 08:22.060
E-Exalted Hero...

08:24.560 --> 08:25.980
I won't let you!

08:26.970 --> 08:29.050
Big Sis Punch!

08:36.990 --> 08:38.500
Wh-What is this place?

08:38.500 --> 08:39.870
Why am I outside?

08:42.030 --> 08:43.120
Everyone...

08:43.350 --> 08:47.630
The one who saved me...
The one who saved all of us...

08:47.950 --> 08:49.210
Are you all right?

08:50.860 --> 08:51.950
I see now.

08:53.000 --> 08:54.220
That person...

08:54.750 --> 08:56.510
That person is...

08:56.940 --> 08:59.390
my... my very own...

08:59.390 --> 09:02.560
Exalted Hero!

09:02.980 --> 09:07.060
Ah, Mother! At long last,
 I've found the Exalted Hero.

09:07.350 --> 09:09.570
But where could the Exalted Hero be?

09:09.570 --> 09:11.990
He disappeared without saying a word.

09:11.990 --> 09:14.360
He really is humble, isn't he?

09:17.610 --> 09:19.290
The Exalted Hero is that way?

09:19.940 --> 09:22.720
I want to hurry up and find him, 
so that I can thank him.

09:24.210 --> 09:26.250
But before that, I need a bath.

09:27.250 --> 09:29.930
Well, that was a missed opportunity.

09:29.930 --> 09:32.020
Are you still hung up on that?

09:32.020 --> 09:34.120
Yeah, I am.

09:34.120 --> 09:36.970
If you'd waited until they woke up
 and led them back to town,

09:36.970 --> 09:38.760
I'm sure you would've gotten a reward.

09:39.020 --> 09:43.130
I was sticky all over and 
reeked of something strange.

09:43.130 --> 09:48.240
I finally met a traditional kind of heroine.
 I didn't want her seeing me like that.

09:48.240 --> 09:50.190
I see. Is that what it was about?

09:50.190 --> 09:51.040
Huh?

09:51.040 --> 09:52.610
Worry not, Asahi!

09:52.610 --> 09:56.430
Your big sister loves you 
even when you're covered in disgusting filth!

09:56.850 --> 09:59.070
Your love is stifling, Maya-nee.

10:00.430 --> 10:01.530
Exalted Hero!

10:03.210 --> 10:05.130
We finally meet again.

10:05.450 --> 10:06.540
Sophie!

10:06.540 --> 10:10.880
Yes. It's me, Sophie Peaceful.
 I've been looking for you, Exalted Hero.

10:11.540 --> 10:14.210
"Hero"? You mean me?

10:14.210 --> 10:17.810
Yes. You saved us.

10:17.810 --> 10:19.670
So you remember being saved, huh?

10:19.670 --> 10:20.680
Of course!

10:21.930 --> 10:26.070
<i>The one who saved them from that
 man-eating plant was actually Maya-nee.</i>

10:26.490 --> 10:28.300
You came all this way to thank me?

10:28.300 --> 10:30.040
Oh, no, not just for that.

10:30.040 --> 10:30.690
Huh?

10:30.690 --> 10:34.690
Exalted Hero, please let me join your party.

10:35.240 --> 10:39.780
Ever since I was little, 
my mother, who's a priestess,

10:40.340 --> 10:44.870
told me to help the Exalted Hero
 who would save the world.

10:45.120 --> 10:48.620
And so that became my dream!

10:49.270 --> 10:53.880
<i>I thought she was the demure type, 
but she's pretty forward.</i>

10:53.880 --> 10:56.610
The time to make that dream 
a reality has now come.

10:56.610 --> 10:58.140
Yes, it has come!

10:58.140 --> 10:59.630
This is divine fate!

11:00.010 --> 11:00.930
What's <i>that</i>?

11:00.380 --> 11:01.840
Is some event starting?

11:00.930 --> 11:02.760
Isn't that one spot, like, super bright?

11:03.020 --> 11:07.450
<i>Leaving all that Hero and dream stuff aside,
having a healer around would be a huge help.</i>

11:07.450 --> 11:08.390
<i>And above all...</i>

11:08.600 --> 11:10.640
<i>she's super cute!</i>

11:11.070 --> 11:12.460
Sure. Happy to have you.

11:12.460 --> 11:16.070
Oh, but I have to check if it's okay
with the rest of the party.

11:16.070 --> 11:17.980
The woman sitting over there?

11:17.980 --> 11:19.310
Yeah. She's my big sis.

11:19.310 --> 11:20.900
Oh! The Exalted Hero's...

11:20.900 --> 11:23.710
Pleased to meet you, 
the Exalted Hero's big sister.

11:23.710 --> 11:25.700
My name is Sophie Peaceful.

11:28.700 --> 11:29.960
<i>M-Maya-nee?</i>

11:29.960 --> 11:31.360
<i>She wouldn't!</i>

11:31.360 --> 11:34.750
You have no right to 
call me "big sister"! Hiss!

11:35.150 --> 11:37.130
This is bad! Wait, Maya-nee!

11:37.130 --> 11:39.770
Calling my little brother 
the "Hero" and revering him...

11:39.770 --> 11:41.980
You have a good eye, Sophie!

11:41.980 --> 11:43.080
Well, of course!

11:43.080 --> 11:43.970
What?

11:45.020 --> 11:48.220
Sh-She's very open-minded 
about people who approve of me.

11:48.930 --> 11:50.760
We've been lookin' for you, Sophie.

11:51.130 --> 11:51.980
You're...

11:51.980 --> 11:54.490
It's <i>your</i> fault we got smashed.

11:54.490 --> 11:56.940
Thanks to you, our rep's in the toilet!

11:56.940 --> 11:59.820
You panicked before you 
even did much healing.

11:59.820 --> 12:02.650
This girl ain't even good 
enough to call "useless."

12:02.650 --> 12:06.070
We let you join 'cause you said
 it was your first expedition.

12:09.530 --> 12:12.040
<i>Poor thing. Look at how scared she is.</i>

12:12.660 --> 12:13.560
...up.

12:13.560 --> 12:14.960
What?

12:15.920 --> 12:17.420
Shut up...

12:17.420 --> 12:19.760
you worthless, cannon-fodder party!

12:21.050 --> 12:22.010
Huh?

