12:22.010 --> 12:25.010
<b>Starting Life
 in Another 
World With 
My Big Sister</b>

12:28.600 --> 12:31.450
An inept leader who charges in
suicidally without issuing orders!

12:31.450 --> 12:31.890
What?

12:32.350 --> 12:35.960
A wizard caked in makeup, whose firepower
 is weak and whose chants are too long!

12:35.960 --> 12:36.730
What?

12:36.980 --> 12:39.680
A joke of a thief who can't 
even disarm a trap effectively!

12:39.680 --> 12:40.320
What?

12:40.320 --> 12:43.570
You don't spare a single thought 
for others! You're brutes! You...

12:43.820 --> 12:44.450
<b>Worthless</b>

12:43.820 --> 12:46.570
worthless, cannon-fodder party!

12:44.450 --> 12:44.530
<b>Worthless</b>

12:44.610 --> 12:46.570
<b>Cannon
Fodder</b>

12:47.130 --> 12:51.370
I picked the wrong clan to join.
 You will now accept my resignation!

12:52.960 --> 12:55.080
Listen up, worthless, 
cannon-fodder party.

12:56.000 --> 12:58.490
I have the Exalted Hero by my side!

12:58.490 --> 12:59.000
What?

12:59.000 --> 13:01.960
I have no further use for you!

13:01.960 --> 13:02.710
What?

13:03.840 --> 13:05.340
<i>What?!</i>

13:05.340 --> 13:09.470
<i>What's with this girl?! I thought she 
was the demure, comforting type!</i>

13:09.470 --> 13:11.850
We ain't gonna stand here
and take that, you brat!

13:11.850 --> 13:14.650
Let's bring a world of hurt
 down on these two!

13:16.980 --> 13:18.870
Wait, can't we talk about this?

13:18.870 --> 13:20.730
Shut up! Quit your yapping!

13:20.730 --> 13:22.150
Uh-oh! A fight!

13:21.820 --> 13:23.530
We'll get caught in the middle! Run! Run!

13:23.840 --> 13:25.240
Don't fight!

13:25.240 --> 13:26.820
If you're fighting, go outside!

13:27.350 --> 13:31.070
Come on, Exalted Hero. Please go 
right ahead and take them all down.

13:31.070 --> 13:32.730
<i>Stop making things worse!</i>

13:32.730 --> 13:35.710
<i>I thought you were a traditional
heroine, but you're just a troublemaker!</i>

13:35.710 --> 13:36.960
Works for me!

13:38.230 --> 13:41.750
<i>If I fight in this situation, everyone 
will find out I'm not that strong.</i>

13:38.230 --> 13:41.750
Yay! Yay! Go! Go! Exalted Hero!

13:41.750 --> 13:43.210
<i>What do I do?</i>

13:45.780 --> 13:46.810
Wh-What's this?

13:46.810 --> 13:48.600
I-It's pepper!

13:48.600 --> 13:50.080
Who could have...

13:55.960 --> 13:58.400
My nose is all itchy.

13:58.710 --> 14:00.310
Oh, my!

14:00.740 --> 14:04.350
That's the Exalted Hero for you! 
He defeated all three in an instant!

14:04.350 --> 14:05.740
Huh? When did I get this money?

14:05.740 --> 14:09.530
Hm? But where <i>is</i> the Exalted Hero? 
His sister isn't here, either.

14:12.130 --> 14:13.610
You saved me, Maya-nee.

14:13.610 --> 14:16.200
But why don't you like Sophie?

14:16.200 --> 14:18.170
You wanted her as an ally, didn't you?

14:18.170 --> 14:21.170
No way. That girl's a total land mine.

14:21.170 --> 14:23.420
<b>Land</b>

14:21.170 --> 14:23.420
<b>Mine</b>

14:21.170 --> 14:23.420
<b>Do not step on\h\h=\h\hDo not get involved with</b>

14:21.170 --> 14:23.420
<b>A figure of speech that describes a particular type of person.</b>

14:23.630 --> 14:25.630
She's Troublemaker Class!

14:25.630 --> 14:27.880
<b>Troublemaker Class</b>

14:25.630 --> 14:27.880
<b>Someone who causes a lot of trouble.</b>

14:27.880 --> 14:30.890
If we're not careful around her,
 horrible things will happen to us!

14:31.900 --> 14:36.050
I thought she was a perceptive girl 
who recognized you as a hero, though.

14:36.050 --> 14:38.520
I really thought she was 
the demure, comforting type.

14:38.930 --> 14:41.770
Oh, is that all? 
But you already have that, right?

14:42.360 --> 14:43.570
The demure...

14:44.060 --> 14:45.570
comforting type.

14:47.990 --> 14:52.750
Wait! Stop! Ow, that's hot! 
The friction's causing a fire!

14:48.460 --> 14:52.750
Now, allow yourself to be babied
 by your big sister! There, there!

14:53.280 --> 14:54.970
That was comforting, wasn't it?

14:55.300 --> 14:59.150
Maya-nee, you kill monsters in an instant.
 You <i>can't</i> be the comforting type.

14:59.150 --> 15:02.120
But, Asahi, that's comforting
 in a way, too, you know?

15:02.120 --> 15:03.210
How do you mean?

15:04.510 --> 15:08.130
Because I give them peace in 
an instant without any suffering.

15:08.130 --> 15:10.110
Death is a relief?

15:12.390 --> 15:14.830
That Pitch-Black Brigade 
seriously ticked me off!

15:14.830 --> 15:19.560
When they got back, they said, "We don't 
remember submitting a request for help."

15:21.140 --> 15:22.920
Next time, I'll just let 'em die.

15:23.610 --> 15:24.870
Now, now...

15:25.530 --> 15:27.680
Let's see... You want a quest, right?

15:27.680 --> 15:30.570
Since it's you, Asahi-kun, maybe 
getting rid of the Troll Sisters?

15:30.570 --> 15:32.490
Um, maybe something easier.

15:33.380 --> 15:37.430
Those guys are way too overconfident, 
and you're too darn humble.

15:38.200 --> 15:41.230
I'm into gaining experience by 
working carefully and steadily.

15:41.230 --> 15:43.230
That's what the real pros do, right?

15:43.230 --> 15:46.040
You really are amazing. Well, in that case...

15:46.040 --> 15:50.010
It's sort of tedious, but I'd recommend 
collecting Killer Bee honey right now.

15:50.010 --> 15:51.570
A gather quest, huh?

15:51.570 --> 15:54.840
Twenty units will be a lot
 to gather on my own.

15:54.840 --> 15:57.100
It'd be nice if Maya-nee were here, but...

15:57.100 --> 16:00.140
Since my last defeat, I have grown stronger.

16:00.140 --> 16:02.560
Ironically, it's all thanks to you!

16:03.660 --> 16:04.730
But...

16:06.520 --> 16:07.900
It isn't enough yet!

16:11.030 --> 16:12.450
I'll say it again!

16:12.840 --> 16:13.860
How tiresome!

16:15.410 --> 16:18.280
Eat everything, <i>including</i> the green peppers.

16:18.280 --> 16:23.190
No way! <i>Never</i>!

16:23.620 --> 16:28.710
Oh, and it might be tough without a healer. 
Killer Bees are venomous, after all.

16:28.710 --> 16:30.020
A healer, huh?

16:30.020 --> 16:33.020
In that case, please leave everything to me!

16:33.840 --> 16:35.160
Sophie...

16:35.160 --> 16:37.890
I finally found you, Exalted Hero.

16:37.890 --> 16:39.930
You were still looking for me?

16:39.930 --> 16:42.330
Come on. Let me join your party.

16:42.330 --> 16:44.480
<i>A-As usual, she's being pretty forceful.</i>

16:44.480 --> 16:47.310
<i>She really is cute, though.</i>

16:47.730 --> 16:50.090
<i>But I need to let her down gently.</i>

16:50.090 --> 16:52.360
So you do know a healer, after all.

16:52.360 --> 16:53.370
Huh?

16:53.370 --> 16:55.470
Let's do our best, Exalted Hero.

16:55.470 --> 16:57.330
I'll mark this quest as accepted, then.

16:57.330 --> 16:59.390
Don't just move the 
conversation on without me!

17:03.960 --> 17:06.370
This is bad. Between the 
damage and the venom...

17:06.370 --> 17:08.590
I will make you well again, Exalted Hero.

17:08.970 --> 17:09.790
Heal!

17:10.250 --> 17:11.940
Wow, thank you.

17:11.940 --> 17:13.510
Now I can keep fighting.

17:18.970 --> 17:20.080
Watch out!

17:19.600 --> 17:20.720
<b>Skill Owned</b>

17:19.600 --> 17:20.720
<b>Stone-Throwing</b>

17:23.570 --> 17:26.140
Thank you so much, Exalted Hero.

17:26.140 --> 17:28.100
<i>You know...</i>

17:28.100 --> 17:31.980
<i>Protecting a girl when it's just
 the two of us is pretty nice.</i>

17:31.980 --> 17:34.190
<i>Feels like I'm the main character in a story.</i>

17:34.720 --> 17:36.920
<i>I don't get that when Maya-nee's around.</i>

17:38.090 --> 17:42.570
Still, Exalted Hero, your fighting style 
seems a little modest and lackluster.

17:43.010 --> 17:45.520
You're stronger than this, 
aren't you, Exalted Hero?

17:45.520 --> 17:49.890
After all, you bested that man-eating plant 
and the Pitch-Black Brigade in an instant.

17:50.780 --> 17:54.680
With these Killer Bees, you're fighting 
steadily and only knocking them out.

17:57.110 --> 17:57.880
That's, uh...

17:57.880 --> 17:58.720
Yes?

17:59.090 --> 18:04.310
That's because thoughtlessly killing 
monsters only disrupts their ecosystem.

18:04.310 --> 18:06.560
And that's what novice adventurers do.

18:06.560 --> 18:07.840
My!

18:07.840 --> 18:11.270
Of course, if this were a hunt quest, 
I'd have taken 'em all out at once.

18:11.270 --> 18:13.020
You're amazing, Exalted Hero.

18:13.020 --> 18:14.240
W-Well, you know...

18:14.240 --> 18:15.570
<i>I survived somehow.</i>

18:16.010 --> 18:18.720
I have nothing but admiration 
for you, Exalted Hero.

18:18.720 --> 18:22.490
I must work hard so that I can prove
 myself worthy of being your ally.

18:23.060 --> 18:24.900
<i>She really is a good person.</i>

18:24.900 --> 18:27.500
<i>Maybe I was wrong to 
treat her so harshly before.</i>

18:27.500 --> 18:30.180
<i>And she hasn't caused any 
problems so far, so...</i>

18:30.180 --> 18:35.320
The Exalted Hero would never fight in a miserly
 way like those baby cannon-fodder dopes!

18:35.320 --> 18:37.510
<i>So she's the venomous-tongued type, after all!</i>

18:43.730 --> 18:45.470
That makes ten, right?

18:45.470 --> 18:48.010
We're only halfway to our goal.

18:48.390 --> 18:49.890
Oh, I know!

18:49.890 --> 18:53.050
Please wait here a moment, Exalted Hero!

18:53.050 --> 18:54.360
Where are you going?

18:55.930 --> 18:57.590
I wonder what happened.

19:00.250 --> 19:03.760
Well, this kind of thing isn't bad, either.

19:04.830 --> 19:06.810
Exalted Hero!

19:08.050 --> 19:09.830
Exalted Hero!

19:09.830 --> 19:12.040
Oh, she's back.

19:12.040 --> 19:14.250
Exalted Hero!

19:14.590 --> 19:16.920
She's really sprinting.

19:16.920 --> 19:20.880
Exalted Hero! Exalted Hero!

19:24.600 --> 19:26.210
No way! No way! What did you do?!

19:26.210 --> 19:30.080
All the attendant Killer Bees will gather,
 too, so I thought it'd be more efficient!

19:30.080 --> 19:31.510
Oh, I see.

19:31.510 --> 19:32.850
Are you <i>stupid</i>?!

19:32.850 --> 19:35.370
Now, Exalted Hero, this is your chance.

19:35.370 --> 19:36.410
I can't! I can't! I can't!

19:36.410 --> 19:38.280
Why are you running away?

19:38.280 --> 19:41.860
Of <i>course</i> I'm running! This'll give away 
my real power level! And above all, I'll die!

19:41.860 --> 19:45.190
E-Exalted Hero! It's catching up!

19:46.720 --> 19:48.290
E-Exalted Hero!

19:52.890 --> 19:55.330
Maya-nee isn't here. What do I do?

19:55.330 --> 19:58.460
No, I just have to make it work somehow.

20:00.990 --> 20:02.330
<i>If I'm a hero...</i>

20:02.720 --> 20:07.000
<i>I have to be able to 
protect one girl at least.</i>

20:21.780 --> 20:22.610
Huh?

20:22.610 --> 20:24.990
Ouch. What happened?

20:24.990 --> 20:29.040
Th-That's amazing, Exalted Hero!
You eliminated them all with earth magic!

20:29.300 --> 20:30.330
Y-Yeah...

20:30.330 --> 20:32.430
Exalted Hero, thank you.

20:32.430 --> 20:33.120
Huh?

20:33.500 --> 20:35.610
It seems I'm always being rescued by you.

20:36.220 --> 20:39.050
A lot happened, 
but we've completed our quest.

20:39.560 --> 20:42.000
Yes, all thanks to you, Exalted Hero.

20:42.000 --> 20:44.550
Sophie, your recovery magic 
was a big help, too.

20:44.550 --> 20:45.790
Oh, right.

20:45.790 --> 20:50.770
Exalted Hero, you must be tired, 
so I'll take these items back and hand them in.

20:50.770 --> 20:51.850
Huh? You sure?

20:51.850 --> 20:54.680
Yes! You just take your time, Exalted Hero.

20:54.680 --> 20:55.690
Well then...

20:55.690 --> 20:57.060
Th-Thank you.

20:57.280 --> 20:59.740
<i>She really is a good person at heart.</i>

20:59.740 --> 21:02.280
<i>But what's the deal with this thing?</i>

21:03.680 --> 21:04.550
Who's there?

21:05.950 --> 21:07.500
Oh, if it isn't Asahi.

21:07.500 --> 21:09.320
Boy, I'm exhausted.

21:09.320 --> 21:12.670
Maya-nee? Kilmaria? Why are you here?

21:12.670 --> 21:15.960
We traveled as we fought and 
ended up all the way over here.

21:15.960 --> 21:19.920
We destroyed a bunch 
of forests and mountains.

21:19.920 --> 21:24.260
Taking inspiration from Asahi... 
Take this! Stone Throw!

21:26.040 --> 21:27.840
Tch. So you dodged it, huh?

21:27.840 --> 21:30.220
Are you really a human?!

21:31.310 --> 21:33.610
So this is the aftermath of your fight, huh?

21:33.610 --> 21:35.730
And what are you doing here, Asahi?

21:35.730 --> 21:37.760
I just finished up a quest.

21:37.760 --> 21:40.230
Then, let's go home together.

21:40.230 --> 21:42.360
I'd like to have meat for my evening meal.

21:42.360 --> 21:44.790
Then, maybe I'll make beef and green peppers.

21:44.790 --> 21:46.180
That's a hard no.

21:46.550 --> 21:48.330
Don't be picky. Just eat it.

21:51.000 --> 21:52.530
Good work today.

21:52.530 --> 21:54.650
Hey, what do you want to eat today?

21:54.650 --> 21:55.740
I feel like pasta.

21:55.740 --> 21:57.180
Want to try that place?

21:56.190 --> 21:58.080
Thank you for your hard work.

21:57.180 --> 21:58.500
Yeah, we could.

21:58.500 --> 22:00.040
Huh? Sophie-san?

22:00.040 --> 22:02.720
You haven't gone home yet? 
It's nighttime already.

22:02.720 --> 22:06.760
Yes, but I must wait for the Exalted Hero.

22:07.140 --> 22:08.760
But are you gonna be all right?

22:10.190 --> 22:10.970
Yes!

22:20.290 --> 22:21.740
Morning, Tanya.

22:21.740 --> 22:22.480
Huh?

22:22.480 --> 22:24.980
Asahi-kun! You're up early.

22:26.090 --> 22:28.150
For some reason, I couldn't sleep.

22:26.530 --> 22:28.990
<b>BZZZZZZ</b>

22:28.990 --> 22:32.870
Now that I think about it, who was that 
black-haired girl you were with before?

22:32.870 --> 22:34.070
Oh, that was...

22:35.390 --> 22:37.490
I-Is that... It can't be.

22:41.890 --> 22:43.250
Exalted Hero!

22:43.970 --> 22:45.580
Good morning!

22:46.300 --> 22:48.270
Don't tell me you were here all night.

22:48.270 --> 22:50.010
Yes, of course I was.

22:50.750 --> 22:53.010
You certainly took a long time, Exalted Hero.

22:53.500 --> 22:56.110
Did you have something else to attend to?

22:56.110 --> 22:57.270
I'm sorry.

22:57.970 --> 22:59.550
I'm really sorry!

23:44.360 --> 23:45.410
<b>Next Time</b>

23:45.020 --> 23:48.030
Next time: "Portrait of a Certain
 Big Sister and Little Brother."

23:45.450 --> 23:45.620
<b>Episode 7</b>

23:45.740 --> 23:49.780
<b>Episode 7</b>

23:46.070 --> 23:49.780
<b>Portrait of a Certain 
Big Sister and Little Brother</b>
